      "id": "docs_superpowers_plans_archive_2026_04_17_chromium_gpu_on_linux_skipinci_removal",
      "label": "Removal of the skipInCI guard on map-interaction tests",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "The guard was added defensively when ANGLE behaviour on headless Linux was unknown; map-reliability.spec.ts passing in CI under chromium-gpu proves ANGLE's software fallback fully initialises MapLibre, so the guard is stale.",
      "source_file": "docs/superpowers/plans/archive/2026-04-17-chromium-gpu-on-linux.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
